WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.304
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Jake. Welcome to Online A two, Book one.

2
00:00:05.604 --> 00:00:09.164
Hi! I'm Sreypich. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.464 --> 00:00:15.449
Unit thirteen: Hobbies and Interests. In this unit, you will talk about your interests and free time.

4
00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:17.242
Hobby.

5
00:00:17.942 --> 00:00:20.963
Hobby means something you enjoy doing in your free time.

6
00:00:21.263 --> 00:00:23.066
Fishing is my grandpa's hobby.

7
00:00:23.766 --> 00:00:26.453
Your turn. Say: Hobby.

8
00:00:29.153 --> 00:00:29.910
Hobby.

9
00:00:30.917 --> 00:00:32.162
Interested in.

10
00:00:32.862 --> 00:00:35.697
Interested in means wanting to know or do more about something.

11
00:00:35.997 --> 00:00:37.579
I'm interested in science.

12
00:00:38.279 --> 00:00:41.221
Your turn. Say: Interested in.

13
00:00:43.921 --> 00:00:45.062
Interested in.

14
00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:46.935
Collect.

15
00:00:47.635 --> 00:00:50.424
Collect means to keep many things of the same kind.

16
00:00:50.724 --> 00:00:52.619
My brother collects stamps.

17
00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:56.494
Your turn. Say: Collect.

18
00:00:59.194 --> 00:01:00.079
Collect.

19
00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:02.119
Photography.

20
00:01:02.819 --> 00:01:05.794
Photography means taking photos as a hobby or job.

21
00:01:06.094 --> 00:01:07.652
I love photography.

22
00:01:08.352 --> 00:01:10.993
Your turn. Say: Photography.

23
00:01:13.693 --> 00:01:14.683
Photography.

24
00:01:15.683 --> 00:01:16.441
Gardening.

25
00:01:17.141 --> 00:01:19.628
Gardening means growing flowers and plants.

26
00:01:19.928 --> 00:01:21.509
Grandma enjoys gardening.

27
00:01:22.209 --> 00:01:24.061
Your turn. Say: Gardening.

28
00:01:26.761 --> 00:01:27.797
Gardening.

29
00:01:28.783 --> 00:01:29.668
Chess.

30
00:01:30.368 --> 00:01:32.588
Chess means a board game for two players.

31
00:01:32.888 --> 00:01:34.366
Let's play chess.

32
00:01:35.066 --> 00:01:37.126
Your turn. Say: Chess.

33
00:01:39.826 --> 00:01:40.653
Chess.

34
00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:42.674
Enjoy.

35
00:01:43.374 --> 00:01:45.652
Enjoy means to like doing something.

36
00:01:45.952 --> 00:01:47.592
I enjoy reading comics.

37
00:01:48.292 --> 00:01:50.457
Your turn. Say: Enjoy.

38
00:01:53.157 --> 00:01:54.239
Enjoy.

39
00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:56.263
Free time.

40
00:01:56.963 --> 00:01:59.961
Free time means time when you don't have to work or study.

41
00:02:00.261 --> 00:02:02.028
What do you do in your free time?

42
00:02:02.728 --> 00:02:05.346
Your turn. Say: Free time.

43
00:02:08.046 --> 00:02:09.000
Free time.

44
00:02:10.017 --> 00:02:12.109
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:12.409 --> 00:02:14.652
Sreypich, what do you do in your free time?

46
00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:19.171
I enjoy photography. I take photos of flowers.

47
00:02:20.483 --> 00:02:22.471
Are you interested in nature?

48
00:02:23.783 --> 00:02:26.503
Yes, I'm really interested in birds and plants.

49
00:02:27.817 --> 00:02:30.153
Does anyone in your family collect things?

50
00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:34.320
My brother collects stamps from different countries.

51
00:02:35.617 --> 00:02:39.509
Grammar focus: Be interested in plus noun and verb-ing.

52
00:02:39.809 --> 00:02:43.320
I'm interested in photography. She's interested in drawing.

53
00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:48.394
After 'interested in', use a noun or a verb with -ing: interested in reading.

54
00:02:49.383 --> 00:02:52.140
Now read and listen. Our Family Hobbies.

55
00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.962
In my free time, I enjoy photography.

56
00:02:56.250 --> 00:03:00.409
I'm interested in nature, so I take photos of flowers and birds.

57
00:03:01.717 --> 00:03:05.086
My brother collects stamps, and he has more than three hundred.

58
00:03:06.383 --> 00:03:09.730
My grandfather loves gardening, and he grows beautiful roses.

59
00:03:11.017 --> 00:03:13.469
Hobbies make our free time fun and interesting.

60
00:03:14.783 --> 00:03:17.238
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:17.538 --> 00:03:19.480
I'm interested blank chess.

62
00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:22.377
A, in. B, on. C, at.

63
00:03:26.383 --> 00:03:27.965
The answer is A: in.

64
00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:31.032
She is interested in blank.

65
00:03:31.332 --> 00:03:34.590
A, draw. B, drawing. C, drew.

66
00:03:38.583 --> 00:03:40.386
The answer is B: drawing.

67
00:03:41.883 --> 00:03:44.127
Growing flowers and plants is blank.

68
00:03:44.427 --> 00:03:48.138
A, gardening. B, photography. C, chess.

69
00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:53.964
The answer is A: gardening.

70
00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:58.427
Now it's your turn to speak. What are you interested in?

71
00:04:03.727 --> 00:04:08.307
I'm interested in music and drawing. In my free time, I enjoy playing the guitar.

72
00:04:08.607 --> 00:04:10.525
Excellent answer, Sreypich!

73
00:04:11.517 --> 00:04:16.224
Great work today! You learned eight new words and be interested in plus noun and verb-ing.

74
00:04:16.524 --> 00:04:19.943
Today's value is passion. Find what you love and practise it.

75
00:04:20.243 --> 00:04:22.999
See you in Unit fourteen. Goodbye!

76
00:04:23.299 --> 00:04:26.381
Thank you, Mr. Jake! Bye, everyone!

